   {
    "type": {
     "value": "persistentslab",
     "display": "Persistent Slab"
    },
    "comment": "<p>A layer of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://migrate.avalanche.ca/glossary/terms/surface-hoar\">surface hoar</a> (up to 40mm below treeline) is buried 50-80cm deep and sits on a crust.</p><p>Use caution in terrain that has not seen recent rider traffic and areas that are more off the beaten path - this is where triggering is most likely.</p><p></p><p></p>",
